Phase 1: Maths for Gen AI

> StatQuest Statistics Fundamentals
(https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLblh5JKOoLUK0FLuzwntyYI10UQFUhsY9)

Study only:

1. Mean, variance, standard deviation
2. Probability distributions
3. Normal distribution
4. Population vs estimated parameters
5. Sampling from a distribution
6. Conditional probability
7. Bayes theorem
8. Expected value
9. Probability vs likelihood
10. Maximum likelihood — main idea only
11. Covariance
12. Pearson correlation
13. Odds
14. Log-odds / logarithms

Optional:
- Central Limit Theorem
- Histograms
- Boxplots

Skip:
- p-values
- hypothesis testing
- confidence intervals
- t-tests
- ANOVA
- power analysis
- bootstrapping
- Q-Q plots

